 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1mggmvfb2/4367e61a-1f47-49a5-9ec2-0915054e834d/dacd05e0-a386-11f0-b4ef-8bc37809d563/file-jaoe38c1mggmvfb3.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>The proton of ethene cannot be abstracted by a second molecule of ethene; hence, a much stronger base such as sodium amide is used to carry out another elimination to form ethyne.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mggmwdcl/d17cdc5e-098d-4f88-9434-106dfb121827/f5190c50-a386-11f0-b4ef-8bc37809d563/file-jaoe38c1mggmwdcm.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1mggmwdcl/d17cdc5e-098d-4f88-9434-106dfb121827/f5190c50-a386-11f0-b4ef-8bc37809d563/file-jaoe38c1mggmwdcm.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2007 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Hydrocarbons Question 7 English Explanation 2\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1mggmwdcl/d17cdc5e-098d-4f88-9434-106dfb121827/f5190c50-a386-11f0-b4ef-8bc37809d563/file-jaoe38c1mggmwdcm.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1mggmwdcl/d17cdc5e-098d-4f88-9434-106dfb121827/f5190c50-a386-11f0-b4ef-8bc37809d563/file-jaoe38c1mggmwdcm.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1mggmwdcl/d17cdc5e-098d-4f88-9434-106dfb121827/f5190c50-a386-11f0-b4ef-8bc37809d563/file-jaoe38c1mggmwdcm.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1mggmwdcl/d17cdc5e-098d-4f88-9434-106dfb121827/f5190c50-a386-11f0-b4ef-8bc37809d563/file-jaoe38c1mggmwdcm.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1mggmwdcl/d17cdc5e-098d-4f88-9434-106dfb121827/f5190c50-a386-11f0-b4ef-8bc37809d563/file-jaoe38c1mggmwdcm.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.c